    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin is an integrated plugin with various features to create versatile pages on your website.<br />\nWith this plugin, you can add various features and create and publish user-friendly pages quickly and easily without writing a single line of code.</p>\n<p>All features can be enabled or disabled individually.</p>\n<h3>Source code</h3>\n<p>The source code of this plugin is available on Github.<br />\nGitHub: https://github.com/eastedge/edge-expansion/</p>\n<h4>Module blocks</h4>\n<p>[ Block Editor ]<br />\nBreadcrumb Trail<br />\nButton<br />\nChild Pages Index<br />\nCustom Post Type</p>\n<p>Dashicons Text<br />\nDefinition List Block<br />\nHTML Sitemap Block<br />\nImage Deformation<br />\nLatest Posts Block<br />\nMeta Discription<br />\nRelated Posts<br />\nSmooth Scroll</p>\n<p>[ Others ]<br />\nAlternate Thumbnail<br />\nButton Back to Top<br />\nSmooth Scroll</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>This plugin can be installed directly from your site.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Log in and navigate to Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Add New.</li>\n<li>Type “Edge Expansion” into the Search and hit Enter.</li>\n<li>Locate Edge Expansion plugin in the list of search results and click Install Now.</li>\n<li>Once installed, Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='can%20edge%20expansion%20be%20used%20with%20any%20theme%3F'>\nCan Edge Expansion be used with any theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Edge Expansion is available for themes that support the block editor.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1.1</h4>\n<p>prefix names unified</p>\n<h4>1.1.0</h4>\n<p>prefix names unified</p>\n<h4>1.0.3.0</h4>\n<p>meta-description　bug fix</p>\n<h4>1.0.1.0</h4>\n<p>meta-description　bug fix</p>\n<h4>0.9.1.0</h4>\n<p>meta-description　bug fix</p>\n<h4>0.9.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>bug fix</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "This plugin is an integrated plugin with various features that will enhance your website.",
    "description": "<p>This plugin is an integrated plugin with various features to create versatile pages on your website.<br />\nWith this plugin, you can add various features and create and publish user-friendly pages quickly and easily without writing a single line of code.</p>\n<p>All features can be enabled or disabled individually.</p>\n<h3>Source code</h3>\n<p>The source code of this plugin is available on Github.<br />\nGitHub: https://github.com/eastedge/edge-expansion/</p>\n<h4>Module blocks</h4>\n<p>[ Block Editor ]<br />\nBreadcrumb Trail<br />\nButton<br />\nChild Pages Index<br />\nCustom Post Type</p>\n<p>Dashicons Text<br />\nDefinition List Block<br />\nHTML Sitemap Block<br />\nImage Deformation<br />\nLatest Posts Block<br />\nMeta Discription<br />\nRelated Posts<br />\nSmooth Scroll</p>\n<p>[ Others ]<br />\nAlternate Thumbnail<br />\nButton Back to Top<br />\nSmooth Scroll</p>\n",
    "download_link": "https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/edge-expansion.1.1.1.zip",
